{"authorID": 5332571, "authorType": 0, "children": [{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": null, "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546811, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2016-11-22T13:18:18Z", "editedAt": null, "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": 546785, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hello,

As Indiegogo is a crowdfunding platform, you did not'order' but instead supported a crowdfunding campaign. 

We have explained the situation with development throughout the campaign with our 134 Updates.", "userComment": null}], "childrenTotalCount": 1, "commentID": 546785, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2016-08-03T12:40:54Z", "editedAt": "2016-08-03T12:40:54Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Can you please give us the option for a refund? This is beyond ridiculous. I ordered something else now and it works flawlessly and it comes with a app. It's not a small and cost $5 a month through Verizon but it came to market and I have no need for this now. I need to protect an item and couldn't wait any longer.  You mislead the public with this device. That's fraud.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": null, "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546811, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2016-11-22T13:18:18Z", "editedAt": null, "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": 546785, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hello,

As Indiegogo is a crowdfunding platform, you did not'order' but instead supported a crowdfunding campaign. 

We have explained the situation with development throughout the campaign with our 134 Updates.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 5302322, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546783, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2016-04-21T08:12:41Z", "editedAt": "2016-04-21T08:12:41Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Dear campaigner,
Can you have the courtesy to inform those of us who do not wish to wait any longer for the product, the procedure for obtaining the refund of our investment?

I posted my request for refund already 2 months ago and received no feedback. Seems I'm not the only one here...", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546764, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-07-08T15:53:28Z", "editedAt": "2015-07-08T15:53:28Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Laurent,

Someone has posted the AliExpress link - http://igg.me/at/st/x/2924259 on their campaign page as a comment over 25 times and every time they delete the comment. I think this action alone tells us that something is not right quite right with their campaign.

They have a taken an existing GPS tracker and re-branded it and claim it is their own. Of this I have no doubt whatsoever.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546762, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-07-08T13:49:01Z", "editedAt": "2015-07-08T13:49:01Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Typical response from our $1 contributor Mark Pulver.

We did the same thing? We did not buy a product in china and re-brand it. We developed it from scratch and have made it as you've seen. We've made several functioning prototypes.

Your agenda is still very clear for all to see Mark Pulver!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546748, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-06-11T12:10:50Z", "editedAt": "2015-06-11T12:10:50Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Jennifer,

Thank you for your comment.

We are actually more focused on completing the project as we set out to do than anything else.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2809653, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546746, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-06-03T19:27:15Z", "editedAt": "2015-06-03T19:27:15Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Where is my Retrievor from November 2013.  I paid $189 and am still waiting.    
If you can't deliver, just let us know and refund our money.    


Mike", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 5048894, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546743, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-06-01T19:41:34Z", "editedAt": "2015-06-01T19:41:34Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Not sure I get the latest update...

You're doing a 2nd campaign and you're going to offer a $199 perk for previous backers...

Ok, so I already gave you $199.. and you want another $199 ?  Is that it?  I'm puzzled by all of that.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546741, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-05-11T17:32:47Z", "editedAt": "2015-05-11T17:32:47Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": ""This project, however filled with good intentions, lacked thorough planning – something we had assumed this builder had."

Not quite Tom. Not lack of planning but more like, lack of serious funding. 

Thanks for your continued support and to Maz too!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546728, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-04-21T17:57:48Z", "editedAt": "2015-04-21T17:57:48Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "@wlittle 25

Please read the "Updates' tab for more information on our project and the changes we have implemented. We have dropped the solar cell and are replacing with our own proprietary power source solution.

There is very little comparison between the TRAX device and our own. Size is already a major factor as our device is much smaller and we are developing  one of the most accurate tracking devices ever and on a very tight budget.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1097395, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546708, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-26T01:32:18Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-26T01:32:18Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "@Bob, my point is that by their own at the _start_ of their campaign TWO years ago, they already had prototypes. So, what happened to that technology?

There are plenty of technical issues here that the owners refuse to address. I asked plenty of questions (and pointed out issues) at the start of this campaign, they deleted most all of that.

I would suggest that your "enthusiasm" for this campaign is suspect. It's much like what you're sharing over on RITOT, which smells bad as well.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 5056485, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546707, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-25T23:06:44Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-25T23:06:44Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "@ Mark Pulver,

And your point is what Mr Pulver? A campaign with $1,600 funded is not likely to get far in developing anything except maybe a toilet roll. 

As far as I can see they have developed 3 versions of prototype since then and are busy with a newer one.  Obviously you are blind to all of this for some strange reason.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546687, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-11T21:14:09Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-11T21:14:09Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "..........

"You have received more than enough money to design and build the specified product"

The Retrievor is already designed (3 times) and built (3 times) however, as minimum quantity for manufacture is 1,000 units, we do not have enough pre- orders to cover this cost or the $25,000 minimum mold cost(s)", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 5062096, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546668, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-07T16:12:39Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-07T16:12:39Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "I read some of these comments and shake my head at the juvenile histrionics displayed by  a few individuals. This is basic common sense:

1. If they were scam artists, and just trying to get money from people, why would they continue to keep us in the loop with updates? They would have taken the money and vanished.

2. And more importantly, why would they have spent any money at all on creating the prototypes? That is a costly venture as anyone in the business world knows.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546667, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-07T16:10:24Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-07T16:10:24Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "E Joseph B,

Let me try to clarify things;

All contributors so far (either those who have contributed to this campaign or pre-ordered directly from our website)  will receive a free RT-100  within  8 weeks after the new campaign ends. They will ALSO receive an RT-101 (the Version 2 device) which is estimated to  shipping Q3  (we have a August '15 shipping date target.)", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4782053, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546662, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-02-07T00:18:05Z", "editedAt": "2015-02-07T00:18:05Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "DA-Fk......

Come again....what are we getting for no additional funds for the money we already paid in THIS campaign?  AND WHEN?

AND if we DID pledge more of our hard earned money obviously just giving us what we already paid for no matter what version that may be, the pot would have to be considerably sweeter to expect anyone to pledge more. like we would get "X" AND "Y" IF and ONLY IF we did pledge more...and jumping to Kickstarter does not fullfill your obligation here to us! Shady.....", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 3963694, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546650, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2015-01-15T17:16:17Z", "editedAt": "2015-01-15T17:16:17Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi,

I don't want to wait any longer. Could I please be refunded for my perk of 199$?

I look forward to hearing from you.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546641, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-10-20T17:07:38Z", "editedAt": "2014-10-20T17:07:38Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Gaston,

We will be posting more videos later and also an update on the status of manufacturing and shipping. As shown on the "Updates" tab, we had encountered a few issues along the way which are now reolved.

Geofencing is a software/application parameter and is not device specific.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546639, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-10-20T01:55:47Z", "editedAt": "2014-10-20T01:55:47Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "@Jupp,

Thank you for bringing customs problems to our attention.

Much appreciated!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4968663, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546638, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-10-19T07:44:19Z", "editedAt": "2014-10-19T07:44:19Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Can you please refund me?

Thanks,



Albert.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4968663, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546634, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-10-09T15:34:45Z", "editedAt": "2014-10-09T15:34:45Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "HI!

What about the video???


Thanks!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4968663, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546617, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-09-05T07:25:50Z", "editedAt": "2014-09-05T07:25:50Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi!

Any news???

Thanks!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4968663, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546609, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-06-30T14:06:17Z", "editedAt": "2014-06-30T14:06:17Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi! 


Any news???


Thanks!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546577, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-04-11T15:44:36Z", "editedAt": "2014-04-11T15:44:36Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Mark Pulver,

It appears yet again that you are failing to pay attention. The first campaign was one for a completely different product as that was not a solar powered GPS tracker. 

We are not waiting for a patent to be issued but are instead waiting to hear that our application is correctly submitted by our lawyers.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4968663, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546573, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-04-08T15:15:49Z", "editedAt": "2014-04-08T15:15:49Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Pictures, samples,... SOMETHING!!!
We have nothing, a part for weak updates without information!!!!

Please!!!!!", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1097395, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546571, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-04-04T17:50:06Z", "editedAt": "2014-04-04T17:50:06Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Ooo,.. name calling. Awesome.

Folks, I know what I linked to, do you know why I linked to it? Inherently it's the same product as Retrievor, the only difference is the radio, and with today's tech, that's nothing. The infrastructure around the radio account is certainly more complex, but that's out of scope here.

Riaan; this campaign has been run before here. They're talked about already having prototypes. But, no one has seen anything except bad screen mockups.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546567, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-04-03T13:10:50Z", "editedAt": "2014-04-03T13:10:50Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Mark Pulver,

I guess the fact that you have made a comparison between our device and that of a bluetooth tracking device shows that you do not understand our product at all.

We will post photos when we have completed manufacturing and units are shipped on route to our customers.. As previously mentioned, we have no protection covering our technology as this is cost prohibitive.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1097395, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546566, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-04-03T12:43:58Z", "editedAt": "2014-04-03T12:43:58Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Don't hold your breath Mark, I and other folks were asking for pics of even a soldering iron months ago. There's a lot in this campaign that doesn't ("didn't") add up - scroll back through the comments to see the back & forth.

Meanwhile, other folks have successfully done what these folks claimed to be doing:

https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/192833321/pebblebee-the-most-versatile-ios-android-bluetooth", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1771899, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546565, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-03-31T17:43:39Z", "editedAt": "2014-03-31T17:43:39Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hey Guys;

Perhaps you can show us some photos of the PCB boards, or something.  

Thanks.

Mark", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546563, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-03-17T18:22:26Z", "editedAt": "2014-03-17T18:22:26Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi Mark & Andi,

We will be posting an update tomorrow morning with information on our progress.

The Retrievor Team", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1771899, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546561, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-03-17T06:16:12Z", "editedAt": "2014-03-17T06:16:12Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "So guys,

Haven't heard from you in a while.  Where are you in the process? 

Mark", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2032290, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546555, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2014-01-22T08:09:40Z", "editedAt": "2014-01-22T08:09:40Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "January comes to an End soon and i would like to know when we will receive the RETRIEVOR 

Perk: The Retrievor Double Up Perk
Voraussichtliches Lieferdatum: January 31, 2014", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 2775796, "authorType": 1, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546550, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2013-12-24T09:47:08Z", "editedAt": "2013-12-24T09:47:08Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Hi grjfield,

Thanks for the comment. 

If you click the 'Updates' tab you will see there was an update posted 14 days ago. We will be updating later today with more news regarding developments etc.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 4735799, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546539, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2013-11-19T07:51:24Z", "editedAt": "2013-11-19T07:51:24Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "80000 - 75214 = 4786
4786 / 353 = 13.56 $

So why not Create a last offer to reach the target... with a little bonus? i suggest more service month..", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 5062096, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546510, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2013-11-03T20:09:18Z", "editedAt": "2013-11-03T20:09:18Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Daniel, 
Just out of curiosity, what does the fact that this Shane person is an avid anti-hunting and hates the thought that animals are sadistically tortured and killed for pleasure have to do with this campaign? I must assume you support hunting and animal sadism.

And I checked out your links, they are obviously the same disgruntled person posting multiple times. I thought you claimed to be a businessman? If that were true you would know you can't make everyone happy.", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1097395, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546502, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2013-11-03T00:57:25Z", "editedAt": "2013-11-03T00:57:25Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "Ah, "first day", yeup, I used the word then.

There are no pictures of a product, the “app running on a phone” on the homepage is a fake, the project timeline in the Gantt chart is impossible, there is mixed information around a prototype or even a proof of concept, people associated with the project continue to belittle those people asking questions.

Why were you vehemently deleting posts? Why won't you answer questions about the project? Why are there no _project_ updates?", "userComment": null}

{"authorID": 1097395, "authorType": 0, "children": [], "childrenTotalCount": 0, "commentID": 546485, "commentThreadID": 30157, "createdAt": "2013-11-01T18:24:43Z", "editedAt": "2013-11-01T18:24:43Z", "isDeleted": false, "isHidden": false, "isReportedByCreator": false, "likesCount": 0, "newerChildrenCount": 0, "newRepliesCount": 0, "parentID": null, "pinnedAt": null, "text": "I watched this campaign from almost the beginning, it's very interesting and I have a real need for two of these. But I bought in at the $2 level in order to ask questions. I've gotten no answers, and many of my original questions and concerns have been deleted. I have copies of all of it.

Why would people delete the questions? Why not just answer them? 

None of this feels good to me, and folks should be really looking at what these folks are claiming.", "userComment": null}

